      <h1>parsing TOML by hand</h1>
      <p class="meta">2026-10-07 &middot; 26 words &middot; <a class="tag" href="/tags/config/">#config</a> <a class="tag" href="/tags/parsing/">#parsing</a> <a class="tag" href="/tags/toml/">#toml</a></p>
      <p id="p1">Dates, times and dotted keys all need care.</p>
      <p id="p2">The spec has 27 ways to be wrong; we test each one.</p>
      <p id="p3">Inline tables may not span lines.</p>
      <p>A <em>pre-rendered</em> note.</p>
