  <main>
    <article>
      <h1>rolling checksums &#34;explained&#34;</h1>
      <p class="meta">2026-10-12 &middot; 22 words &middot; <a class="tag" href="/tags/algorithms/">#algorithms</a> <a class="tag" href="/tags/sync/">#sync</a></p>
      <p id="p1">A weak sum slides one byte at a time.</p>
      <p id="p2">A strong hash confirms each candidate block.</p>
      <p id="p3">Only the differences cross the wire.</p>
      <p class="prev">Previous: <a href="/parsing-toml/">Parsing toml by hand</a></p>
